WEBVTT

00:15:29.478 --> 00:15:31.375
"We're designing software for a phone

00:15:31.399 --> 00:15:33.199
and it has to do some specific thing,

00:15:33.223 --> 00:15:34.976
and it can only use so much memory."

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.427
That's the kind of specificity you need.

00:15:37.451 --> 00:15:39.310
Well, that's the end of my talk.

00:15:39.334 --> 00:15:41.577
And I just want to thank
everybody for coming.

00:15:41.601 --> 00:15:42.976
It was great to be here.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:50.000
(Applause)

00:15:54.526 --> 00:15:56.717
(Applause ends)

00:15:56.741 --> 00:15:58.566
Oh -- you have a question for me? OK.

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:00.987
(Applause)